{"type":"message","id":"08ca70bc","parentId":"e8af969f","timestamp":"2026-07-28T13:07:09.762Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now let me check if there's anything else to do. According to SOUL.md, for FEED_DRAIN mode with STEP25_GATE=OFF, we should skip the user confirmation gate and proceed directly to publishing. We've successfully:\n1. Built picker input from feed job ID 104\n2. Spawned picker agent\n3. Validated picks\n4. Spawned researcher agent\n5. Validated research\n6. Spawned writer agent\n7. Synced and validated article\n8. Spawned creator agent for feature image\n9. Published to WordPress as draft\n10. Sent Telegram card\n11. Run cleanup\n\nThe FEED_DRAIN cron job has been completed successfully. Let me send a final completion message:\n\n**FEED_DRAIN PIPELINE COMPLETE**\n\n- **Project:** memecoinist\n- **Feed Job ID:** 104\n- **Story:** \"Shiba Inu volume surge slows after 12-fold jump - 디지털투데이\"\n- **Category:** shiba-inu-coin\n- **WordPress Draft:** https://memecoinist.com/?p=38131\n- **Telegram Card:** Sent (message ID: 745)\n- **Status:** Story published as draft, card sent to group\n\nThe single-story feed drain pipeline has executed successfully from start to finish.\n\nNO_REPLY"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bedrock-mantle","model":"deepseek.v3.2","usage":{"input":43431,"output":296,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43983,"cost":{"input":0.027795840000000002,"output":0.00056536,"cacheRead":0.00004096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.028402160000000003}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1785244013890,"responseId":"chatcmpl-c3b650d1-e615-4267-a68b-c007974fe778"}}
